ai-gateway for Debian/Ubuntu
=============================

Code installs to /opt/ai-gateway, runtime data to /var/lib/ai-gateway.
data/ is a symlink, so all documented relative paths keep working.

Quick start:
  systemctl status ai-gateway
  curl -k https://127.0.0.1:16384/health
  /opt/ai-gateway/agw.sh status

CLI (agw) is NOT in PATH by default; use:
  ln -s /opt/ai-gateway/agw.js /usr/local/bin/agw

First install: edit /var/lib/ai-gateway/config.json (set your API key),

(copied from /opt/ai-gateway/config.default.json at first install; upgrades never touch /var/lib). .agwkey auto-generated at first install (600).

Encryption: config*.json are AGWENC1 (AES-256-GCM) encrypted with
/var/lib/ai-gateway/.agwkey - treat it as the root secret, backup both.
